# ============================================================================
# Project layout convention
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   repo root/
#     README.md, LICENSE            repo front page
#     whale_schedule/
#       main/                       the wallpaper itself (WE: pick THIS folder)
#       keying/                     chroma-key screen-recording variant
#       tests/ tools/ docs/ data/   auxiliary engineering files
#       anim/ build/                promo animation / build output
#
# Only a few re-generatable or unrelated things need ignoring, so new
# engineering files can be dropped into whale_schedule/ without ever touching
# this file again.
# ============================================================================

# --- re-generatable / too large for the repo ---

# ffmpeg binaries (~313MB; GitHub rejects files over 100MB)
whale_schedule/tools/bin/

# render & build intermediates (frame sequences, recovery caches)
whale_schedule/build/

# scratch space used by the test harness (headless Chrome profiles etc.)
_tmp_verify/

# legacy uncropped artwork, superseded by whale_schedule/main/image/
whale_schedule/main/image_origin/

# old Bilibili intro animation, local only
whale_schedule/main/intro/

# unrelated side project, must not leak into this repo
dsh-whale-widget/
dsh-whale-widget.zip
whale_schedule/docs/old-assets-v0.2.10/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.log
